# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This repository is the format, the tools and the decoder. The private
# artifact built with them — its recording, payload, QR images and card
# artwork — is not part of it, and lives only in the local working copy and
# the offline archive copies.
#
# card_text.txt holds the text engraved on that specific card. make_card.py
# itself is generic and is committed; without the file it falls back to
# placeholders and says so in its run summary.
#
# A repository cannot be un-published. Keep it that way.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
audio/
qr/
artwork/
docs/
HANDOFF.md
card_text.txt

